; Error-case sample: each call triggers a different diagnostic.

MACRO
ADD3 &A, &B, &C
ADD AREG, &A
ADD AREG, &B
ADD AREG, &C
MEND

MACRO
SCALE &X, &K=2
MUL &X, &K
MEND

START
ADD3 P, Q              ; too few positional args
ADD3 P, Q, R, S        ; too many positional args
SCALE V, BAD=ZZZ       ; unknown keyword
END
